      "title": "二分查找左端位置",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "tags": ["algorithms", "binary-search", "lists"],
      "prompt": "实现 `binary_search(values, target)`，在按非递减顺序排列的整数列表中查找 `target`，返回它第一次出现的索引。若目标不存在，返回 `-1`。\n\n列表可能包含重复值，也可能为空。请使用二分查找逐步缩小区间，不得调用 `list.index()`。",
      "function_name": "binary_search",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {"name": "values", "type": "list[int]"},
          {"name": "target", "type": "int"}
        ],
        "returns": "int"
      },
      "starter_code": "def binary_search(values: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    return -1\n",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [[1, 3, 5, 7, 9], 7],
          "expected": 3,
          "explanation": "目标位于有序列表的中后部。"
        },
        {
          "args": [[1, 2, 2, 2, 4], 2],
          "expected": 1,
          "explanation": "存在重复值时返回最左侧索引。"
        },
        {
          "args": [[-8, -3, 0, 6], 5],
          "expected": -1,
          "explanation": "目标不在列表中。"
        },
        {
          "args": [[], 10],
          "expected": -1,
          "explanation": "空列表中不存在任何目标。"
        }
      ]
    },
