    {
      "slug": "css-specificity",
      "lesson_source_path": "Day31-35/32-33.Web前端入门.md",
      "title": "计算 CSS 选择器优先级",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "tags": ["css", "parsing", "strings"],
      "prompt": "实现 `selector_specificity(selector)`，计算一个简化 CSS 选择器的优先级，返回 `[id_count, class_count, type_count]`。输入只包含一条选择器链，不含逗号、转义或函数式伪类；复合选择器可由空白、`>`、`+`、`~` 分隔。\n\n计数规则：`#id` 计入 ID；`.class`、`[attribute]` 和单冒号伪类（如 `:hover`）计入 class；元素名和双冒号伪元素（如 `::before`）计入 type；通配符 `*` 不计分。选择器保证符合上述简化语法。",
      "function_name": "selector_specificity",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {"name": "selector", "type": "str"}
        ],
        "returns": "list[int]"
      },
      "starter_code": "def selector_specificity(selector: str) -> list[int]:\n    return [0, 0, 0]\n",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": ["#app .card > h2.title"],
          "expected": [1, 2, 1],
          "explanation": "一个 ID、两个类和一个元素名。"
        },
        {
          "args": ["main[data-theme] a:hover"],
          "expected": [0, 2, 2],
          "explanation": "属性与伪类计入 class，main 与 a 计入 type。"
        },
        {
          "args": ["article::before"],
          "expected": [0, 0, 2],
          "explanation": "元素名和伪元素各计一个 type。"
        },
        {
          "args": ["* .notice + button[disabled]"],
          "expected": [0, 2, 1],
          "explanation": "通配符不计分，类和属性计入 class，button 计入 type。"
        }
      ]
    },
